@TwitterClone.api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5266

### 1. Get All Users
GET {{TwitterClone.api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create User
POST {{TwitterClone.api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

###

